Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:02.58,EN,,0,0,0,,DEE's interest lies in bringing\Ncapabilities together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:05.07,EN,,0,0,0,,within its own computational dynamics:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.20,EN,,0,0,0,,retaining experience, revising it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:09.42,EN,,0,0,0,,combining it and using information.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:12.13,EN,,0,0,0,,This basis enables exploration\Nof adaptive agents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:14.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and new forms of memory and processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:18.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Specific applications and advantages\Nmust be evaluated through testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:23.73,EN,,0,0,0,,DEE Cognitive: demonstrated capabilities,\Nan intelligent system in development.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:26.99,EN,,0,0,0,,The invitation is to investigate,\Nreproduce and develop.
